#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:123 8bd1f20a33fb4d37b32049dabe0ec808
msgid "**Name**: ``NCA_fit_one_compartment``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:125 6c0fe6c224b94fb097f84fbcca205058
msgid ""
"**Description**: Fit a one-compartment IV bolus pharmacokinetic model "
"(C(t) = C0 × exp(-k\\_el × t)) to plasma concentration-time data using "
"nonlinear least squares. Returns C0 (initial concentration), k\\_el "
"(elimination rate constant), t½ (half-life), R², and when dose is "
"provided: Vd (volume of distribution) and CL (clearance). Assumes mono-"
"exponential decline — appropriate for drugs with rapid distribution and "
"linear elimination. If R² < 0.85, consider a two-compartment model. Use "
"NCA\\_compute\\_parameters for model-independent analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:129 b9c68ecfb5f84fca851a6d7b3d8b119e
msgid ""
"``times`` (array) (required) Time points after IV administration. "
"Example: [0, 0.5, 1, 2, 4, 8, 12, 24]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:132 5eb7c67d6ac84d9ba11df3e5d605c1eb
msgid ""
"``concentrations`` (array) (required) Plasma concentrations at each time "
"point. Example: [500, 380, 290, 170, 60, 8, 1.1, 0.1]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:135 3e04feafcdc34a2295a6379f8f41b1e7
msgid ""
"``dose`` (number, null) (optional) Administered IV dose. Required to "
"calculate Vd and CL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nca_tools.rst:138 745abb599a13418c9108674aee1f3a8c
msgid "``dose_unit`` (string, null) (optional) Unit of dose (default: 'mg')."
msgstr ""

